# The far volume of the grass (reports/engine/2026-11-19-grass-far-volume): pairs of one moment, with the layer and
# without it (`grass parts 1024`), still air, noon. Fields from above, where the ground past 48 m fills the frame,
# and at the game's eye height, where it should hardly show. Run on Ryzen at 2560x1440 with the live game's set:
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> scripts/bench.sh grass-far-volume <out>
# Shots <view>-on and <view>-off; with `grass parts 512` <view>-bands, the ground by the bands of its distance.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode walk
watch player
cloth wind calm
# Onar's fields from the slope above them
goto NW_BIGFARM_FARM4_PATH_07
cam at 64807 5560 -10675 55841 1768 -11459
clear 3000
wait 15000
grass wait
wait 2000
grass stats
shot onar-on
wait 300
grass parts 1024
wait 1000
shot onar-off
wait 300
grass parts 512
wait 1000
shot onar-bands
wait 300
grass parts 0
